OL,3,GNEWSADesigner wraps blanket heritage
OL,4,Ainto fashion contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young designer is highlighting local
OL,7,Fcraftsmanship through her womenswear
OL,8,Fcollection for an international fashion
OL,9,Fcompetition.
OL,11,FAlexandra Burch, 19, from Witney is
OL,12,Famong the eight finalists on the
OL,13,FRedress Design Award, which challenges
OL,14,Femerging designers to use certified
OL,15,Ftextile waste for their creations.
OL,17,FCotswold Remnants celebrates her
OL,18,Fhometown heritage of blanket making and
OL,19,Fis "entirely made from materials and
OL,20,Foffcuts salvaged from the Cotswold
OL,21,FWoollen Weavers, a mill that sadly had
OL,22,Fto permanently close this year".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
